<h2>Welcome, <%= name %>!</h2>
<p>Your <%= role %> account has been successfully created on the <strong>Placement Management System</strong>.</p>
<div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 24px; border-radius: 16px; margin: 24px 0; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;">
    Next Steps:
  </p>
  <ul style="margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">
    <% if (role === 'student') { %>
      <li>Complete your profile with academic details</li>
      <li>Build your elite professional resume</li>
      <li>Start applying for top-tier opportunities</li>
    <% } else { %>
      <li>Complete your company profile and recruiter details</li>
      <li>Your account is currently <strong style="color: #ea580c;">pending administrator approval</strong></li>
      <li>You will be notified once you are cleared to post job openings</li>
    <% } %>
  </ul>
</div>
<div style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="btn">Access Portal</a>
</div>
<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; margin-top: 32px;">
  If you have any questions, please reply to this email.
</p>
